{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q129642582","formula":"C₄₅H₇₂N₁₆O₈S","hill":"C45H72N16O8S","elements":["H","C","N","O","S"],"composition":{"C":45.0,"H":72.0,"N":16.0,"O":8.0,"S":1.0},"names":{"en":"LIH383"},"descriptions":{"en":"LIH383 is an octapeptide and highly potent and selective agonist of the atypical chemokine receptor ACKR3 (CXCR7) that was derived from the opioid peptide adrenorphin. ACKR3 is a novel opioid receptor which functions as a broad-spectrum trap or scavenger for endogenous opioid peptides, including enkephalins, dynorphins, and nociceptin, and thereby acts as a negative modulator of the opioid system. By displacing them from ACKR3 and thereby increasing their availability, LIH383 potentiates the actions of endogenous opioids, for instance their analgesic effects."},"fame":1,"pubchemCid":168287525,"mass":997.2,"charge":0,"smiles":"CSCC[C@@H](C(=O)N[C@@H](CCCN=C(N)N)C(=O)N[C@@H](CCCN=C(N)N)C(=O)N[C@@H](CCCCN)C(=O)N)NC(=O)[C@H](CC1=CC=CC=C1)NC(=O)CNC(=O)CNC(=O)[C@H](CC2=CC=CC=C2)N","inchikey":"HKVZPBVWPFDBBQ-LBBUGJAGSA-N","iupac":"(2S)-6-amino-2-[[(2S)-2-[[(2S)-2-[[(2S)-2-[[(2S)-2-[[2-[[2-[[(2S)-2-amino-3-phenylpropanoyl]amino]acetyl]amino]acetyl]amino]-3-phenylpropanoyl]amino]-4-methylsulfanylbutanoyl]amino]-5-(diaminomethylideneamino)pentanoyl]amino]-5-(diaminomethylideneamino)pentanoyl]amino]hexanamide","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"168287525","atoms":142,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-2.433,"y":5.323,"z":2.083,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.874,"y":3.599,"z":2.086,"el":"S"},{"x":-3.452,"y":2.803,"z":2.571,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.248,"y":1.442,"z":3.243,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.849,"y":0.282,"z":2.319,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.946,"y":-0.045,"z":1.276,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.134,"y":0.211,"z":1.455,"el":"O"},{"x":-3.496,"y":-0.807,"z":0.222,"el